ys flip from performance problem to flickering.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen a sub window (node picker, colour picker, file picker etc) in seemingly any context.\nIn rare cases, opening the subwindow will tank performance to below 1 frame per second until i minimise godot or close the subwindow.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102604/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102604/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}